{"abstract":"We present the BigMC tool for bigraphical reactive systems that may be instantiated as a verification tool for any formalism or domain-specific modelling language encoded as a bigraphical reactive system. We introduce the syntax and use of BigMC, and exemplify its use with two small examples: a textbook “philosophers” example, and an example motivated by a ubiquitous computing application. We give a tractable heuristic with which to approximate interference between reaction rules, and prove this analysis to be safe. We provide a mechanism for state reachability checking of bigraphical reactive systems, based upon properties expressed in terms of matching, and describe a checking algorithm that makes use of the causation heuristic.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Perrone, Gian David","Debois, Søren","Hildebrandt, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382577"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bigraphs","Domain specific modelling languages","Reachability analysis","Reactive systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a verification environment for bigraphs","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11334-013-0210-2","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382577","identifier":[{"id":"84878406868","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-583fca1a-fd86-47fb-9e53-decd4c1bc0bc"],"keyword":["Bigraphs","Domain-specific modelling languages","Reachability analysis","Reactive Systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-88196D673DCB4753BA30711FB1ACEF40"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11334-013-0210-2","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gian David","key":"perronepau","last":"Perrone","name":"Perrone, Gian David","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"deboispau","last":"Debois","name":"Debois, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"hildebrandtpau","last":"Hildebrandt","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s11334-013-0210-2","issn":["16145046","16145054"],"issn_org":["16145046"],"issue":"2","journal":"Innovations in Systems and Software Engineering","pages":"95-104","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Innovations in Systems and Software Engineering","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84878406868"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-583fca1a-fd86-47fb-9e53-decd4c1bc0bc"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A verification environment for bigraphs","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382577","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"We propose a mechanism for the vertical reﬁnement of bigraphical reactive systems, based upon a mechanism for limiting observations and utilising the underlying categorical structure of bigraphs. We present a motivating example to demonstrate that the proposed notion of reﬁnement is sensible with respect to the theory of bigraphical reactive systems; and we propose a sufﬁcient condition for guaranteeing the existence of a safety-preserving vertical reﬁnement. We postulate the existence of a complimentary notion of horizontal reﬁnement for bigraphical agents, and ﬁnally we discuss the connection of this work to the general reﬁnement of Reeves and Streader","author_count":3,"contributors":["Perrone, Gian David","Debois, Søren","Hildebrandt, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381812"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bigraphical Reactive Systems","Categorical structure","Horizontal refinement","Safety preserving","Vertical refinement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bigraphical refinement","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.55","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381812","ids":["itu-2447e78a-df0d-4859-ab59-4553e65463a2"],"keyword":["Bigraphical reactive systems","Categorical structure","Horizontal refinement","Safety-preserving","Vertical refinement"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0E1C5DDB1E4BB074911CFA4C68542D5F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.55","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://eptcs.org/","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://cgi.cse.unsw.edu.au/~rvg/eptcs/content.cgi?Refine2011","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gian David","key":"perronepau","last":"Perrone","name":"Perrone, Gian David","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"deboispau","last":"Debois","name":"Debois, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"hildebrandtpau","last":"Hildebrandt","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4204/eptcs.55","issn":["20752180"],"pages":"20-36","publisher":"University of New South Wales Press","series":"Electronic Proceedings in Theoretical Computer Science. EPTCS","status":"p","title":"Electronic Proceedings in Theoretical Computer Science. EPTCS","volume":"55"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84965173713"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-2447e78a-df0d-4859-ab59-4553e65463a2"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Bigraphical Refinement","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381812","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We present a model checking tool for Bigraphical Reactive Systems that may be instantiated as a model checker for any formalism or domain-specific modelling language encoded as a Bigraphical Reactive System. We describe the implementation of the tool, and how it can be used to verify correctness properties of some infinite-state models by applying a static analysis to reaction rules that permits the exclusion of some infinite branches of execution shown to always be free of violations. We give a proof of correctness for this method, and illustrate the usage of the tool with two examples — a textbook implementation of the Dining Philosophers prob- lem, and an example motivated by a ubiquitous computing application.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Perrone, Gian David","Debois, Søren","Hildebrandt, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384977"],"event":{"end":"2012-03-30","place":"Riva del Garda, it","start":"2012-03-26","title":"ACM Symposium on Applied Computing 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bigraphical Reactive Systems","Formal verification","Infinite State Models","Model checking","Static analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a model checker for bigraphs","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/2245276.2231985","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384977","identifier":[{"id":"84863594592","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-fc0d85e2-570a-4bf4-b7ce-6f002e5c397f"],"keyword":["Bigraphical Reactive Systems","Formal Verification","Infinite-State Models","Model Checking","Static Analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9C4668C811A93BB39DE03634E4AEFF03"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/2245276.2231985","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gian David","key":"perronepau","last":"Perrone","name":"Perrone, Gian David","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"deboispau","last":"Debois","name":"Debois, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"hildebrandtpau","last":"Hildebrandt","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2245276.2231985","isbn":["9781450308571"],"pages":"1320-1325","place":"New York, NY, USA","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"SAC '12. Proceedings of the 27th Annual ACM Symposium on Applied Computing"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84863594592"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-fc0d85e2-570a-4bf4-b7ce-6f002e5c397f"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Model Checker for Bigraphs","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384977","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
